      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "ZIPPING POPYRIN (1) turned in a solid run last start over 324m at this track finishing 4th and beaten only 4 lengths (17.78). Reliable out of the boxes and should take advantage of the inside draw. Looks the one to beat on his best form. FEVER DREAM (3) is better than last start when fourth (18.00) in a Grade 5 at this track over 324m. Should be in this for a long way. WAHOO BLUE (6) missed the frame and was safely held latest finishing 8th at Bulli following on from a third place finish (19.78) there the start prior. Speedy beginner who can find the front despite the tricky draw. Should be about the money. EXPLORE (8) cannot be ruled out.",
